Netmender [sad]: Her mother went from this dock too. Same age near enough. #line:ch02_bark_dock_001
Fisher [neutral]: Then she'll have fair weather. Her mother did. #line:ch02_bark_dock_002
Rhen [neutral]: Went where? #line:ch02_bark_dock_003
Netmender [neutral]: Out. Pass me that float, would you? #line:ch02_bark_dock_004
